Command: uv run pytest tests/reserve/test_reserve_formulation.py::test_risk_group_ignores_mapping_to_offer_outside_active_domain -q
Exit code: 1

The official RTD qualification case exposed the same focused failure:

KeyError: Index ('C1', 'T1', 'INACTIVE') is not valid for indexed component
'EnergyOffers.Generation'.

The risk-group mapping contained a legitimate source record for an offer that
was absent from the active generation domain; the constraint builder did not
filter it before indexing the Pyomo variable.
